# components/ and hooks/

## components/

- `components/ui/` — shadcn **Base Nova** (`@base-ui/react`) + Telecel wrappers (`Heading`, `Text`, `SearchInput`, `EmptyState`, `DatePicker`, `FileUpload`, `Link`, …). Add missing shadcn pieces with `npx shadcn@latest add <name>`; do not hand-roll Button/Input/Dialog if shadcn has it
- `components/layout/` — `Container`, `Section`, `Stack`, `Grid`, `PageContainer`, `SiteNavbar`, `SiteFooter`, error screens. Prefer these over raw `container-site` / ad-hoc section markup when editing UI
- Do not import Radix. Prefer Base UI `render` over Radix `asChild`. Menu/dialog triggers already render a button — style with `buttonVariants()`, do not nest `<Button>` (nested buttons break hydration)
- Typography: `Heading` + `Text`. Portal pages: `PortalPageHeader`. Do not add new one-off `font-heading text-*` stacks in feature components
- Empty / search: `EmptyState`, `SearchInput`
- Icons from `lucide-react`. Classes via `cn()` from `lib/utils.ts`
- Dates shown in UI: `formatDate` / `formatDateTime` from `lib/format.ts`
- `components/[feature]/` — reused across routes; one-off page UI stays in `app/`
- Never import Supabase clients or `data/`/`actions/` query builders here — pages/actions call those
- Forms: `react-hook-form` + `zodResolver` against a `validations/` schema + `Field`
- Skeletons: route `loading.tsx` via `RouteSkeleton` (boneyard-js). shadcn `Skeleton` only for small inline placeholders

## hooks/

- Shared: `useDebounce`, `useDebouncedSearchParam`, `useMobile`
- Realtime wrappers only when live updates are required, not by default
